#, no-wrap
msgid "Prerequisites"
msgstr "事前準備"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/foundations/modules/ROOT/pages/description.adoc:7
msgid "This course includes instruction to ensure learners are at the same level before delving into biodiversity data mobilization topics."
msgstr "本課程包含相關教學內容，旨在確保學員達到相同的水準，再深入探討生物多樣性資料流通的相關主題。"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/foundations/modules/ROOT/pages/description.adoc:11
msgid "Terminology and definitions of basic concepts, functions, and processes"
msgstr "基本概念、功能及流程的術語與定義"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/foundations/modules/ROOT/pages/description.adoc:12
msgid "Introduction to data quality"
msgstr "資料品質簡介"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/foundations/modules/ROOT/pages/description.adoc:13
msgid "Importance of documentation"
msgstr "文件記錄的重要性"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/foundations/modules/ROOT/pages/description.adoc:15
msgid "This course is comprised of video and written instruction."
msgstr "本課程包含影片與書面教學內容。"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/foundations/modules/ROOT/pages/description.adoc:22
msgid "This course is designed for anyone who is interested in completing the Biodiversity Data Mobilization course and sharing data with GBIF."
msgstr "本課程專為有興趣完成「生物多樣性資料流通」課程，並與 GBIF 分享資料的人士而設計。"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/foundations/modules/ROOT/pages/description.adoc:30
msgid "There are no prerequisites for this course.  This course serves as a prerequisite for the Biodiversity Data Mobilization course."
msgstr "本課程無先修條件。本課程為「生物多樣性資料流通」課程的先修課程。"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/foundations/modules/ROOT/pages/description.adoc:32
#: en/intro-to-gbif/modules/ROOT/pages/description.adoc:34
msgid "While efforts are made to provide materials in other languages, videos will be in English. Efforts are made to include subtitles when possible."
msgstr "雖然我們會盡力提供其他語言的資料，但影片將以英文呈現。我們會盡可能提供字幕。"

